sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CL as Clinician (Web)
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant REC as Recommendation Service (GKE)
    participant PG as Cloud SQL
    participant BQ as BigQuery Audit
    participant FAM as Family Portal

    CL->>LB: GET /patient/{id}/recommendation
    LB->>REC: Forward (auth via service ingress)
    REC->>PG: Fetch patient state + assessments
    PG-->>REC: State + latest assessments
    REC->>REC: Apply eligibility rules
    REC->>REC: Run GBM ranking on eligible pathways
    REC-->>LB: Ranked pathways + reasons
    LB-->>CL: 200 OK with ranked list

    Note over CL,REC: Clinician reviews, optionally overrides

    CL->>LB: POST /patient/{id}/decision
    LB->>REC: Forward decision
    REC->>PG: Update patient pathway state
    REC->>BQ: Append audit (recommendation + decision + clinician)
    REC->>FAM: Publish notification (if consented + material change)
    REC-->>LB: 200 OK
    LB-->>CL: Decision confirmed
